WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:32,960
Come to my office. Why do you want me to sit down with you? What's going on today?

2
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:37,000
Thank you very much. I really don’t know what I would do today without you.

3
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,600
Maybe this contract can be signed successfully?

4
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:49,100
It's all a big problem. It's serious. What kind of approval is this?

5
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,460
Why do you take this to finance?

6
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,980
This is the bonus of 200,000 yuan that I specially approved for you.

7
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:00,060
Your handwriting is very beautiful, Chen Yundong

8
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,500
I'm serious with you

9
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:02,900
Thanks to you this time

10
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:09,630
Chen Yundong, what are you doing? Are you crazy? Did you write this note to thank me?

11
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:18,850
I received your thank you. Is there anything wrong with you? This is the approval note. I signed and stamped it.

12
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:25,290
You have to get it from the finance department and go through the formalities before the finance department will send you the money. Do you know that?

13
00:01:25,290 --> 00:01:28,580
It's because I accept your apology that I tear up this note.

14
00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:29,580
It's because I don't want the money
